! Test 01: HCl HF/LANL2DZ - analytical hessian with ECP
! Expected: ~3047.6 cm-1 (should match numerical within ~1 cm-1)
%method  HF
%basis   lanl2dz
%ecp     lanl2dz
%job     freq
%hess_method analytical
*geometry angstrom
 H    0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
 Cl   0.000000    0.000000    1.274500
*end
